  {
    "@id": "https://www.tightropetheatre.com/events/studio-narrative-tilts",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Studio: Narrative & Tilts | Tightrope Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><u><strong>Studio: Narrative &amp; Tilts</strong></u></p>\n<p>This 5-week course will open up all the possibilities of story. We will develop skills to make captivating beginnings, what we call the Platform, and how to find a change or Tilt to your scene for maximum impact. We will explore this through game, scene work, genre-based  storytelling, and long-form narratives. Gain access to the magical powers that will enhance improvised scene work in any style.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Upcoming dates: </strong></p>\n<p>November 18 - December 16 | Mondays 6pm-8:30pm</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><u>Accessibility info:</u></p>\n<p>The main entrance is the ground floor. The door is wide enough to accommodate a standardized wheelchair and electric wheelchair. Our main lobby, bar and theatre are wheelchair accessible. Our stage is not as it is raised about 4inches off the ground.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Our bathrooms are not wheelchair accessible. The closest wheelchair accessible washroom is at the Mount Pleasant Community Centre, across the street from the theatre. Their hours of operations are Monday-Friday, 6 am to 10 pm, Saturday, 8  am to 6 pm, and Sunday, 9 am to 6 pm.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>If you have further concerns or questions regarding accessibility during workshops, please email education&#64;tightropetheatre.com.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://www.tightropetheatre.com/events/studio-narrative-tilts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tightrope Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#type": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "website"
      }
    ]
  },
