  {
    "@id": "https://www.tightropetheatre.com/events/studio-status-character",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Studio: Status & Character | Tightrope Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><u><strong>Studio: Status &amp; Character</strong></u></p>\n<p><em>Prerequisite: Foundations series, or by video interview/audition.</em></p>\n<p>This 5-week course will give you tools and training to spontaneously create believable and entertaining characters in scenes. We will explore techniques of status and power dynamics, physical acuity, outrageous  attitudes and more. We will mine the comedic potential of authentic human behaviour, so you can expand your character range and create  compelling stories in any improvisational style. Side Show Performance on the final class.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Upcoming dates:</strong></p>\n<p>October 20 - November 17 | Sundays 4:30pm-7pm</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><u>Accessibility info:</u></p>\n<p>The main entrance is the ground floor. The door is wide enough to accommodate a standardized wheelchair and electric wheelchair. Our main lobby, bar and theatre are wheelchair accessible. Our stage is not as it is raised about 4inches off the ground.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Our bathrooms are not wheelchair accessible. The closest wheelchair accessible washroom is at the Mount Pleasant Community Centre, across the street from the theatre. Their hours of operations are Monday-Friday, 6 am to 10 pm, Saturday, 8  am to 6 pm, and Sunday, 9 am to 6 pm.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>If you have further concerns or questions regarding accessibility during workshops, please email education&#64;tightropetheatre.com.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://www.tightropetheatre.com/events/studio-status-character"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tightrope Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#type": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "website"
      }
    ]
  },
